      "message": "Please familiarize yourself with go/java-practices/futures for how Futures are best used.\n\nThis code is currently mixing up what threads various pieces of work are doing. You shouldn\u0027t need to use `ThreadUtils` at all.\n\n```\nListenableFuture bgWork \u003d mExecutorService.submit(() -\u003e {\n    // work that needs to be done in background\n});\nFutures.addCallback(bgWork, new FutureCallback\u003c\u003e() {\n    public void onSuccess(...) {\n        // work that needs to be done in foreground\n    }\n},\nContextCompat.getMainExecutor(mContext));\n```",
